---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import educationData from '../data/education.json';
---

<Layout
  title="Education & Academic Research | Doruk Doğan"
  description="Academic background of Doruk Doğan — M.A. in New Media (ICA Paris 2022 conference publication) and Double Major B.A. in Media & Visual Arts and Sociology from Koç University."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-20 space-y-12">
    
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/50 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800 text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 text-xs font-semibold">
        <span>Academic Background</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Education & Research
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        A multidisciplinary foundation combining computational media theory, sociological consumer research, and visual design aesthetics.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Conference Spotlight Banner -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/10 via-slate-900/5 to-slate-900/10 dark:from-emerald-950/30 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-slate-950 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/60 shadow-sm space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400">
        <span>🏆 Academic Spotlight</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>ICA 2022 Paris</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        International Communication Association Conference Paper
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Master's thesis on new media ecosystems and digital engagement was peer-reviewed, accepted, and converted into an official conference paper presented at the <strong>72nd Annual International Communication Association (ICA) Conference</strong> in Paris, France.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Education Degree Cards -->
    <div class="space-y-8">
      {educationData.map((item) => (
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#0f172a] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              {item.degree}
            </h2>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 code-font">
              {item.year}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-4">
            {item.institution} · {item.location}
          </div>

          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-4">
            ✨ {item.highlight}
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            {item.description}
          </p>

          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 mb-2">
              Key Academic Topics
            </h4>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
              {item.topics.map((t) => (
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                  <span class="text-emerald-500">▪</span>
                  <span>{t}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- How Academia Informs Strategy -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-3">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        How Academic Research Informs My Marketing & Product Strategy
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Marketing without sociological understanding is just guesswork. My background in qualitative fieldwork, statistical survey design, and computational communication enables me to analyze audience segments not merely as numbers on an analytics dashboard, but as dynamic social ecosystems with distinct cultural motivations and behavioral drivers.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
